Patient describes symptoms in Swahili:
"Ninahisi maumivu ya kichwa na joto la mwili."

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:29,100
Speak or type symptoms in English, Swahili, Yoruba, Hausa,
and more. Our agent will triage your case.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,500
The AI agent classifies intent as triage, assesses urgency
in real time, and recommends next steps.

6
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,300
Escalating: severe chest pain.
Watch the urgency flip to emergency.

7
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:57,500
Built for Africa, by Africa. AfriVoice Triage —
MLC Africa × Intron Agentic Voice AI Challenge 2026.
